[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to outline the design specifications of the GBSK HVPS Interface
Bootloader Firmware.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes the design modules and sub-modules of the GBSK HVPS Interface
Bootloader Firmware.
The information in this document is derived from the HVPS Interface Bootloader FW SRS, referenced in
this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware components.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

